    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking offers over 199,000\n\nRight in the heart of Wexford Town, Hill Street is an easy walk to Wexford's Main Street, public parks, shops - all the amenities you might need.\nNo. 13 was given a complete overhaul in 2012 with plumbing, electrics and heating system all upgraded/newly installed.\nOn the ground floor is an open plan living area leading directly into the kitchen. The living area has a stove and the kitchen benefits from natural light from a large skylight and a rear facing window. To the back of the kitchen is the main bathroom. A glazed door leads to the west facing patio area which is fully enclosed. Upstairs are two bedrooms.\nHill Street is always a popular location so if you are looking for a first home, investment property or simply a town central bolt hole - No. 13 might just fit the bill for you.\nMains services, broadband available, upgraded in 2012."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nOPEN PLAN LIVING INTO KITCHEN AREA - \n\n\nLiving Room - 6m x 3.5m\nwith laminate flooring, stove and open tread stairs to the rear\n\nKitchen - 4.6m x 2.9m\nwith tiled floor, rear facing window and large skylight, glazed door to rear patio area, Hot Press 0.9m x 0.6m\n\nBathroom - 1.9m x 1.9m\nfully tiled with WC, WHB, bath with mixer shower tap\n\nLanding - 0.8m x 0.7m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.6m x 2.4m\nfront facing room with carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.9m x 2.7m\ncarpet flooring and rear window onto flat roof\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>55 sqm terraced home</li><li>A short walk to Wexford's Main Street</li><li>Heating, plumbing and electrics updated in 2012</li><li>Open plan living/kitchen area on the ground floor</li><li>Bathroom to the rear (GF)</li><li>2 bedrooms upstairs</li><li>West facing patio area to the rear</li><li>Mains services, OFCH (installed 2012)</ul>"
      },
